/// Fixture for `http_exchange_adapter_test.bt`: an `HTTPHandler` actor
/// that echoes the request body. Proves adapter dispatch to an actor is a
/// real actor send (the handler runs in its own process, never touching
/// the Exchange).
Actor subclass: EchoHandler

  handle: req => HTTPResponse new: #{#status => 200, #body => req body}
